sition":"1787595957746471001-07a93a3f-bb04-494e-8133-7d25134f5e27"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"35a6116e25faddf038955ed8b6dfcee049761bce27991755c7adbaac8d3bda4f","event_uuid":"1c893e5a-d5b0-488d-b2a1-5568128c2490","position":{"commit_sha":"9718a5c8f5e5a20b5c0bb4c993797f4eab1dc9c7","position":"1787595967686179001-1c893e5a-d5b0-488d-b2a1-5568128c2490"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null},{"content_hash":"321668d56cd5783008476ec2f76c3952fe18d7fb98166a96922d80e924205121","event_uuid":"eab17c94-72ce-4441-a102-e690d174a9ca","position":{"commit_sha":"502be3d321a5880bd9cb01e076a2f4c13ebd23cd","position":"1787595990573547001-eab17c94-72ce-4441-a102-e690d174a9ca"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":null}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"comments":[],"created_at":1787595926603806001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"07a93a3f-bb04-494e-8133-7d25134f5e27","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"3f22-7fd4-aae7-48b4"},{"link_uuid":"1c893e5a-d5b0-488d-b2a1-5568128c2490","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"cf0f-2e26-87ca-47a8"},{"link_uuid":"eab17c94-72ce-4441-a102-e690d174a9ca","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"bd66-28a4-fd31-4c9f"}],"description":"## Context\nWhile validating the duration-probe change for similar-operose-alligator, an unchanged-tree full-suite rerun completed all 16,691 tests but produced two teardown errors. In both cases the autouse repository-isolation guard reached tests/conftest.py::_no_repo_commits after the test body passed, then tests/_isolation.py::head timed out its read-only git -C <worktree> rev-parse HEAD child at the fixed five-second watchdog. The failing nodes were test_snapshot_cache_by_sha and one test_registry_lane_transient_failures parameter. A prior unchanged-tree run passed completely.\n\nClosed bug callous-amused-hart introduced the five-second watchdog after measuring 100 unloaded probes at median 0.0143s, p95 0.0164s, max 0.0610s. That calibration did not measure the guard under the full-suite concurrent workload. The present root cause is not yet known: live candidates include host/process-spawn saturation, Git/object-store contention, inherited test state, or an incorrectly calibrated watchdog.\n\n## Plan\n- Reproduce and quantify head() probe latency sequentially and under controlled concurrency matching the suite worker/process load.\n- Capture runtime process/stack state for a slow probe and distinguish Git execution, process creation/waiting, shared-repository contention, and test-state contamination.\n- Compare the reported-against tree (2e890ab37f7e, base fcc740dba9b) with current origin/main and inspect history since the watchdog landed.\n- Confirm or reject each falsifiable hypothesis before proposing any repair. If a product defect is proven, follow held-out RED-to-GREEN repair and reproduce the original full-suite scenario.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] The failure rate and latency distribution are quantified under stated sequential and concurrent conditions.\n- [ ] Runtime evidence identifies the exact stage that consumes the five-second budget.\n- [ ] A discriminating experiment proves one root cause and rules out viable alternatives.\n- [ ] The ticket records defect legitimacy and origin, or an evidence-backed environment/config classification.\n- [ ] Any repair is proven RED then GREEN and the original full-suite scenario no longer reproduces.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[["relates_to","bd66-28a4-fd31-4c9f"],["relates_to","cf0f-2e26-87ca-47a8"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"08e19208-5d13-480c-ae94-7141e0d46339","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["test-reliability","git","repo-isolation","performance"],"ticket_id":"0654-547c-02b6-4522","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Repo-isolation HEAD watchdog false-fails under full-suite load","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1c3efe3a-52c8-449b-9e9a-c24505dd749d","08e19208-5d13-480c-ae94-7141e0d46339","797e00ab-2ba5-4c4b-9d9f-f337e52b14a1","07a93a3f-bb04-494e-8133-7d25134f5e27","1c893e5a-d5b0-488d-b2a1-5568128c2490","eab17c94-72ce-4441-a102-e690d174a9ca"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787603587178921001,"uuid":"66041a3c-e390-4555-877b-7519b6e4253b"}